                      (   unit_tests.asm):05812         
                      (   unit_tests.asm):05813         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
                      (   unit_tests.asm):05814         ; Control-flow test harness (glossary section 3.8). Each test
                      (   unit_tests.asm):05815         ; redirects CODEHERE to a scratch buffer (TSTCBUF), calls the
                      (   unit_tests.asm):05816         ; real compile-time control-flow words directly (JSR IF, JSR
                      (   unit_tests.asm):05817         ; THEN, etc - the same routines the compiler itself calls when
                      (   unit_tests.asm):05818         ; parsing IF/THEN/DO/LOOP/etc, not a hand-simulated imitation),
                      (   unit_tests.asm):05819         ; then restores CODEHERE and executes the compiled snippet
                      (   unit_tests.asm):05820         ; directly. This tests the actual interaction between compile-
                      (   unit_tests.asm):05821         ; time correctness (right bytes, right patched offsets) and
