                      (   unit_tests.asm):07655         ; flow balance baseline, sets STATE compiling; a literal 111 is
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07656         ; compiled; SEMI compiles the closing RTS, checks the CSP
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07657         ; balance, un-smudges the header, restores STATE) - then
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07658         ; executes the result and verifies it pushes 111. Also verifies
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07659         ; the header's own SMUDGE bit is correctly clear after SEMI -
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07660         ; not just that execution happened to work.
