                      (   unit_tests.asm):09146         ; dictionary header, TSTNAMEB for a fake source name). POSTPONE
                      (   unit_tests.asm):09147         ; is this section's own hardest case: a genuine two-level
                      (   unit_tests.asm):09148         ; compile-time mechanism (compiling code that, for a normal
                      (   unit_tests.asm):09149         ; word, itself compiles a call to that word later, when the
                      (   unit_tests.asm):09150         ; current definition eventually runs - not immediately, unlike
