                      (   unit_tests.asm):11048         ; TSTCODEHERE - combined unit test for , C, ALLOT, and HERE
                      (   unit_tests.asm):11049         ; together (glossary section 3.11's own CODEHERE-region words).
                      (   unit_tests.asm):11050         ; Redirects CODEHERE to scratch and walks through a sequence:
                      (   unit_tests.asm):11051         ; HERE reports the redirected value, COMMA appends a cell (and
                      (   unit_tests.asm):11052         ; the written cell is verified directly, not just the advance),
                      (   unit_tests.asm):11053         ; C, appends a byte (verified the same way), ALLOT reserves then
                      (   unit_tests.asm):11054         ; releases bytes (confirming both directions work, matching
                      (   unit_tests.asm):11055         ; "reserve (or release, if negative)"), and a final HERE
                      (   unit_tests.asm):11056         ; confirms the cumulative result.
