                      (   unit_tests.asm):14883         ; involved, so none of this section's tests need the
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14884         ; SERIALPOLL-conditional complexity used throughout the printing
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14885         ; sections. Combined into one test, given each word's own
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14886         ; effect is trivially verified by reading BASE directly - four
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14887         ; separate tests would just repeat the same save/set/verify/
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14888         ; restore shape four times over. TSTBASAV (added in section
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14889         ; 3.13, when the real, pre-COLD BASE=0 bug was found and fixed)
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14890         ; is reused here to save/restore the real BASE across this test
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14891         ; too, per the same established reasoning.
