                      (   unit_tests.asm):15340         ; TSTLPAREN - unit test for (. Fake source "hi)m" with TOIN
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15341         ; starting at 0 - verifies TOIN lands exactly past the closing
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15342         ; paren (at 3, immediately before "m", not consuming it), and
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15343         ; that the data stack is genuinely unchanged - the specific
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15344         ; behavior the bug-fix comment describes as previously broken.
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15345         ; Since ( only ever advances TOIN, never SRCADDR itself, the
