                      (   unit_tests.asm):15839                                             ; alongside "BASE=10", in the very same
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15840                                             ; init block), which hasn't run yet at
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15841                                             ; this whole test framework's own,
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15842                                             ; pre-COLD execution point. With
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15843                                             ; LATEST=0, FIND reports every word,
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15844                                             ; including the real "+" this test
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15845                                             ; evaluates, as not found - INTERPRET
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15846                                             ; then falls through trying to parse
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15847                                             ; "+" as a number, fails that too, and
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15848                                             ; throws an error this test never
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15849                                             ; catches, landing at THUNCAU's own
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15850                                             ; JMP ABORT - which resets the return
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15851                                             ; stack, explaining exactly why the
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15852                                             ; user's own test run terminated
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15853                                             ; without ever reaching TSTENVQUERY1/2/
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15854                                             ; 3. The same class of gap as section
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15855                                             ; 3.13's own BASE=0 finding, just for a
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15856                                             ; different variable this section's
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15857                                             ; own EVALUATE test was the first to
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15858                                             ; genuinely depend on.
