                      (    forth6809.asm):03739                     ; that point - confirmed nothing else in this routine, including
                      (    forth6809.asm):03740                     ; NUMLOOP/UDMULADD, ever touches CADDR) rather than remembered
                      (    forth6809.asm):03741                     ; in a new persistent flag here - GLOBALS is fully packed at
                      (    forth6809.asm):03742                     ; 256/256 bytes, and this avoids needing to carve out a byte
                      (    forth6809.asm):03743                     ; for it.
