E493 43               (    forth6809.asm):03805                     COMA
E494 53               (    forth6809.asm):03806                     COMB
E495 3501             (    forth6809.asm):03807                     PULS  CC                ; restore the TRUE carry
E497 2403             (    forth6809.asm):03808                     BCC   NQSTOREHI         ; BUG FIX: this used to be "BCC NQPOS32",
