                      (    forth6809.asm):03810                                             ; when there's no carry - the complemented
                      (    forth6809.asm):03811                                             ; value was computed in D but never
                      (    forth6809.asm):03812                                             ; actually stored back to UDHI in that
                      (    forth6809.asm):03813                                             ; case, leaving it at its stale, pre-
