                      (    forth6809.asm):07830                                             ; time). Answers HOLDMINSIZE (34), not the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07831                                             ; larger PADOFFSET (128) - HOLDMINSIZE is
                      (    forth6809.asm):07832                                             ; specifically the portion of the
