                      (    forth6809.asm):07838                                             ; is the total gap width, most of which is
                      (    forth6809.asm):07839                                             ; actually earmarked for WORD's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):07840                                             ; parsing - reporting it here would
                      (    forth6809.asm):07841                                             ; overstate what HOLD can safely use
                      (    forth6809.asm):07842                                             ; without risking collision with whatever
                      (    forth6809.asm):07843                                             ; WORD is doing in the same space.
