                      (    forth6809.asm):07845                                             ; NEW: /PAD, the last of the two
                      (    forth6809.asm):07846                                             ; entries the top-of-file note originally
                      (    forth6809.asm):07847                                             ; flagged as absent - now both present.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07848                                             ; Answers PADMINSIZE (128) directly, per
                      (    forth6809.asm):07849                                             ; ANS's own /PAD meaning (3.3.3.6, "the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07850                                             ; size of the scratch area whose address
                      (    forth6809.asm):07851                                             ; is returned by PAD") - PAD's own region,
                      (    forth6809.asm):07852                                             ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):07853                                             ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):07854                                             ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07855                                             ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
                      (    forth6809.asm):07856                                             ; in the CODEHERE-to-PAD gap). PADOFFSET
                      (    forth6809.asm):07857                                             ; happens to equal PADMINSIZE numerically
                      (    forth6809.asm):07858                                             ; in this implementation (PADOFFSET EQU
                      (    forth6809.asm):07859                                             ; PADMINSIZE), but /PAD is answered with
                      (    forth6809.asm):07860                                             ; the conceptually correct constant, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07861                                             ; the coincidentally-equal one.
FD1B FD6800070000     (    forth6809.asm):07862                     FDB   EN9,EN9L,0        ; NEW: FLOORED - previously the one item
                      (    forth6809.asm):07863                                             ; in this area explicitly left open
                      (    forth6809.asm):07864                                             ; pending its own investigation (unlike
                      (    forth6809.asm):07865                                             ; WORDLISTS, this is a CORE query, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07866                                             ; tied to an unimplemented optional word
                      (    forth6809.asm):07867                                             ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07868                                             ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):07869                                             ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):07870                                             ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):07871                                             ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07872                                             ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07873                                             ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):07874                                             ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):07875                                             ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):07876                                             ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):07877                                             ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):07878                                             ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07879                                             ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):07880                                             ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):07881                                             ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):07882                                             ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):07883                                             ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):07884                                             ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):07885                                             ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):07886                                             ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):07887                                             ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):07888                                             ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
